---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact GovWait" description="Contact GovWait about data corrections, licensing, press questions or technical issues." noindex={true}>
  <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> › Contact</nav>
  <h1>Contact GovWait</h1>
  <p class="lede">Email <a href="mailto:contact@govwait.com">contact@govwait.com</a> for corrections, data licensing, press questions or technical problems.</p>

  <div class="policy-grid">
    <section><h2>Data correction</h2><p>Include the GovWait page, the official-source page and the value that appears inconsistent. See the <a href="/corrections/">corrections process</a>.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Reuse or press</h2><p>Describe the dataset, route or report you plan to cite. The public API is available without an account under the stated attribution terms.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Technical issue</h2><p>Include the URL, approximate time, browser and what you expected to happen. Do not include passwords, tokens or personal application records.</p></section>
  </div>

  <div class="callout warn"><strong>GovWait cannot check or expedite an individual application.</strong> For case status, account problems or legal questions, use the linked official agency rather than sending personal documents here.</div>
</Base>
